{
  "$comment": [
    "HAND-EDITED. This is the only file in the pipeline besides sources.lock.json that a person writes and the build reads.",
    "It carries the third pass of the cross-language correspondence: what somebody looked at and decided. Everything else is computed.",
    "",
    "pairs[]         {en, fr, note?}  — two records a person paired that the data could not.",
    "no_equivalent[] {id, note?}      — a record a person examined and found to have NO counterpart in the other language.",
    "",
    "no_equivalent is a THIRD STATE and not a tidier way of saying 'still pending'. A record nobody has looked at and a record",
    "somebody established has no twin are different facts; collapsing them means searching forever for something already known",
    "not to exist. It is also the only state that CLOSES a question, so it is the one to enter most reluctantly — a note saying",
    "how it was established is worth more here than anywhere else in the repository.",
    "",
    "Every identifier is checked against the catalogue at build time. A typo does not become a pair and does not vanish either:",
    "it comes back in `refusals` in exports/srd/correspondence.json, named. A signature that contradicts a computed pair is",
    "refused too, deliberately — a person disagreeing with the data is something to look at, not something to apply silently.",
    "",
    "",
    "CUMULATIF. Une passe de signatures n'efface pas la precedente : on ajoute, on ne remplace pas.",
    "Passe du 2026-08-22 (Eric) : 95 paires, dont 5 que la mesure avait deja trouvees a l'identique -- celles-la",
    "ressortent en `confirmed_by: human` sur la paire calculee, pas en doublon. Deux portent une note : elles sont",
    "conditionnelles a la reparation d'extraction et devront s'apparier seules le jour ou elle est faite.",
    "",
    "See docs/CORRESPONDENCE.md."
  ],
